---
description: Detect project languages and configure opencode LSP servers.
---

Enable opencode LSP for this project. Inspect the current project files and dependency/config files to identify every language in active use. Check whether this project already has an opencode config file. Add or merge a project-local opencode config with an `lsp` object for each detected language, using installed language-server commands when available. Do not overwrite unrelated existing config. Prefer project-local configuration over changing global config. If required language-server commands are missing or cannot be installed safely, do not guess: report the exact packages/commands the user should install and show the exact opencode `lsp` config entries needed. Verify the resulting config shape against https://opencode.ai/config.json before finishing.
